# Our Anna's Greetings and Special Message!

I offer my appreciation upon learning that *Dravidan* is publishing a special issue on today's question of opposition to Hindi, in a manner that will gladden the hearts of admirers who have long praised the distinguished service rendered by the journal.

There is no doubt that the special issue provides everyone an opportunity to understand the views concerning opposition to Hindi and recognise the justice of our righteous struggle. I wish every party comrade to possess this issue.

Madras  
Annadurai  
10-1-6.3

(*Dravidan*, 12 October 1962)
